# Title: CobaltStrike Load by Rundll32
# ID: ae9c6a7c-9521-42a6-915e-5aaa8689d529
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Wojciech Lesicki
# Date: 2021-06-01
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218.011
# Description: Rundll32 can be use by Cobalt Strike with StartW function to load DLLs from the command line.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:*.dll* AND (process.command_line:* StartW OR process.command_line:*,StartW)) AND ((process.executable:*\\rundll32.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"RUNDLL32.EXE") OR ((process.command_line:*rundll32.exe* OR process.command_line:*rundll32 *))))
